sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-zajac-convergent-extension-intercalation> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-zajac-convergent-extension-intercalation-overall> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (primary) + Claude Sonnet 5.5 High (independent second assessor)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-zajac-convergent-extension-intercalation-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Zajac, Jones & Glazier (2000, 2003) / Bertet, Sulak & Lecuit (2004) anisotropic differential adhesion and polarized T1 junctional intercalation in convergent extension — MorphoEval overall 60.7/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Pass 1 baseline assessment of `2003-zajac-convergent-extension-intercalation.py` (61.2/100). The initial script implements the 64-cell Zajac et al. (2003) anisotropic adhesion energy J(theta) = J_0 - Delta_J cos(2*theta), Bertet et al. (2004) planar-polarized vertical junction tension Lambda(theta) = Lambda_0 - Delta_Lambda cos(2*theta), and incompressible 2D pure-shear scaling R_CE(t) = R_0 exp(2*dot_epsilon*t), but requires explicit midpoint RK2 ODE convergence verification against the analytical pure-shear solution, angular rose-histogram cross-correlation against the confocal Xenopus specimen (`convergent_extension_axis_specimen.jpg`), finer 15x15 2D morphospace resolution, and full `claim_boundary` provenance metadata. Overall 60.7/100 (faithfulness 60.0, reproducibility 62.2); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 64, Morphological realism / specimen match 57, Parameter expressivity 61, Morphometric validation 59, Source and data traceability 65, Code-to-model traceability 62, Reproducibility package 60. Output judged: docs/media/convergent_extension_intercalation_comparison.png: rendered output of 2003-zajac-convergent-extension-intercalation.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 766141 B, 2408×1428 px, artifact_sha256 a11c5fb7b4c7f5f6341d299c41a798581da67d2fcb854b952069a39d1810e432 (sha256 a11c5fb7b4c7f5f6341d299c41a798581da67d2fcb854b952069a39d1810e432), spec_fingerprint 70c0d2a81cec84a4a194e326ee3833640573b76865ed3d8f4c5ff14fdbf4448d. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 70c0d2a81cec84a4a194e326ee3833640573b76865ed3d8f4c5ff14fdbf4448d; artifact_sha256: a11c5fb7b4c7f5f6341d299c41a798581da67d2fcb854b952069a39d1810e432; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/convergent_extension_intercalation/convergent_extension_axis_specimen.jpg=0c2620bce19ad4cf..., datasets/convergent_extension_intercalation/convergent_extension_intercalation_reference.json=5e3d70d1a6711a38..., datasets/convergent_extension_intercalation/scout_manifest.json=66a1e6f4d0f0a745...}." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add explicit midpoint RK2 ODE integration and analytical convergence verification against R_CE(t) = R_0 exp(2*dot_epsilon_T1*t) (L2 relative error < 1e-6).",
            "remediation needed: Compute angular rose-histogram profile correlation between the Zajac-Bertet cos(2*theta) / von Mises planar polarity distribution and the empirical Xenopus chordamesoderm rose diagram (Panel b' in `convergent_extension_axis_specimen.jpg`, r > 0.96).",
            "remediation needed: Upgrade the 2D parameter morphospace grid to 15x15, expand `measure_morphoeval()` to 7 reference-pinned metrics, and add full `claim_boundary` provenance metadata." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.607"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .
}

